## Recommended Batch 10 (Opus-direct, 2 items, ~70-75K combined)

### Item 1: Quotation UI (T2-T3, ~45-55K)
Second consumer of the tRPC React client. The quotation lifecycle has rich
interactive behavior (line item editing, markup column add/edit, send/accept/reject
buttons, revision history) — perfect fit for the new React client.

Files to touch:
- apps/web/src/app/(tenant)/[slug]/(app)/crm/quotations/page.tsx — NEW: list
  with status filter chips + search + paginated table. Server Component fetches
  initial data, embeds a small <QuotationListFilters /> Client Component for
  filter state (no full Client Component needed for the list table itself).
- apps/web/src/app/(tenant)/[slug]/(app)/crm/quotations/[id]/page.tsx — NEW:
  detail page with sections + markup-column table + line items + revisions
  sidebar. Use a <QuotationActions /> Client Component for the
  Send / Accept / Reject / Create Revision buttons (trpc useMutation hooks).
- apps/web/src/app/(tenant)/[slug]/(app)/crm/quotations/new/page.tsx — NEW:
  build flow with sections + markup columns + line items. Heavy interactivity
  — extract math to apps/web/src/lib/quotation-build.ts (pure helpers
  mirroring server-side computation), unit-test directly. Pattern is the same
  as pos-cart.ts from Batch 9 Item 1.
- (Optional) PDF preview — defer to Batch 11 if scope balloons.

### Item 2: CRM ContactLog router (T2, ~25K)
Server-only — the original Batch 9 .whatsnext recommendation that was deferred
because the model doesn't exist yet.

Files to touch:
- packages/db/prisma/schema.prisma — NEW model ContactLog { id, customerId,
  type (call|email|meeting|note), subject, body, occurredAt, createdById,
  createdAt, updatedAt }. Migration: pnpm db:migrate (creates table).
- apps/web/src/server/trpc/routers/crm.ts — add contactLog* procedures
  (~6: list, byId, create, update, delete, listForCustomer).
- apps/web/src/__tests__/crm.test.ts — extend with ~10 new tests.

